# Normalize line endings: store text files with LF in the repo, let Git
# convert to the platform's native line ending on checkout. Fixes the
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warning every commit in this repo has been
# printing on Windows.
* text=auto

# Never touch line endings in binary assets.
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
